<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="How does an orchestra sound?" id="0017272e" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsGray" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" slideid="1" sequence="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Una orquesta es un pequeño microcosmos donde conviven todo tipo de instrumentos, cada uno de ellos con sus propias virtudes y sonoridades. Las orquestas han variado mucho con el paso de los siglos, sobre todo por número de intérpretes; han ido incluyendo cada vez más músicos, conforme las obras musicales requerían mayor volumen sonoro y mayor variedad de timbres. Pero hay algo que se ha mantenido a lo largo del tiempo, y es que, a pesar de estar formada por varias familias de instrumentos muy distintas entre sí, dependen íntimamente unos de otros para dar forma a las obras que los grandes compositores nos han dejado.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La orquesta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>1_Orquesta_wBar.jpg</image><audiofile>00170830.mp3</audiofile><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="38" y="204"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>78</x><y>196</y></point><point><x>115</x><y>181</y></point><point><x>135</x><y>193</y></point><point><x>137</x><y>205</y></point><point><x>131</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>78</x><y>196</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;El director&lt;br&gt;de orquesta&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="230" y="184"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>99</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>174</y></point><point><x>75</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>105</x><y>179</y></point><point><x>128</x><y>181</y></point><point><x>142</x><y>194</y></point><point><x>143</x><y>209</y></point><point><x>137</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>380</x><y>291</y></point><point><x>417</x><y>239</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>157</y></point><point><x>382</x><y>121</y></point><point><x>134</x><y>174</y></point><point><x>154</x><y>89</y></point><point><x>112</x><y>81</y></point><point><x>52</x><y>86</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>99</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de cuerda&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="38" y="129"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>149</x><y>125</y></point><point><x>139</x><y>169</y></point><point><x>238</x><y>149</y></point><point><x>149</x><y>125</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de&lt;br&gt;viento-madera&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="4" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="283" y="60"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>159</x><y>87</y></point><point><x>153</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>242</x><y>144</y></point><point><x>385</x><y>118</y></point><point><x>337</x><y>93</y></point><point><x>275</x><y>69</y></point><point><x>238</x><y>110</y></point><point><x>159</x><y>87</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos&lt;br&gt;de viento-metal&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="5" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="38" y="31"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>62</y></point><point><x>71</x><y>46</y></point><point><x>164</x><y>48</y></point><point><x>265</x><y>67</y></point><point><x>234</x><y>102</y></point><point><x>137</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>72</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>93</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>62</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos&lt;br&gt;de percusión&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B826CC7</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D96EDC</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La orquesta&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="3" sequence="2"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La sección de cuerda de una orquesta es la más numerosa y está formada por los violines, las violas, los violonchelos y los contrabajos. Todos estos instrumentos están fabricados con madera, y tienen una forma muy parecida, aunque su tamaño sea muy diferente. El hecho de que haya tantos intérpretes en la sección de cuerda permite que se puedan crear sonidos densos que combinen bien con el resto de los instrumentos. En algunas ocasiones, si la pieza que se va a interpretar lo requiere, también se puede encontrar una o más arpas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de cuerda&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>image_strings.swf</image><imagerefid/></caption><image>3_de-cuerda_new.jpg</image><audiofile>0017A524.mp3</audiofile><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="6" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="20" y="242"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Violín&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>10</x><y>346</y></point><point><x>85</x><y>355</y></point><point><x>76</x><y>6</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Violín&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="16" y="243" w="48" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="6" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="103" y="251"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Viola&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>81</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>91</x><y>339</y></point><point><x>161</x><y>344</y></point><point><x>157</x><y>8</y></point><point><x>81</x><y>5</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Viola&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="99" y="252" w="43" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="6" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="179" y="284"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Violonchelo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>162</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>171</x><y>334</y></point><point><x>273</x><y>346</y></point><point><x>268</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>162</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Violonchelo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="175" y="285" w="89" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="6" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="305" y="343"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Contrabajo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>272</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>280</x><y>367</y></point><point><x>405</x><y>370</y></point><point><x>401</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>272</x><y>7</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Contrabajo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="301" y="344" w="84" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1b826def, 1b82e9b1, 1b823728, 42d975ce</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D97B23</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de cuerda&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="4" sequence="3"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;En este grupo encontramos a los clarinetes, las flautas, los fagotes y los oboes, y a veces también a los saxofones. En muchas ocasiones, estos instrumentos cobran protagonismo y dialogan, como solistas, con el resto de la orquesta. Esto se debe a que su timbre y su sonido son idóneos para crear frases musicales propias dentro de la gran orquesta.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de viento-madera&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>image_winds.swf</image><imagerefid/></caption><image>4_de-viento-madera.jpg</image><audiofile>0017A527.mp3</audiofile><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="178" y="2"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Flauta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>69</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>70</y></point><point><x>417</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Flauta&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="174" y="3" w="52" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="346" y="75"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Oboe&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>317</x><y>76</y></point><point><x>316</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>77</y></point><point><x>317</x><y>76</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Oboe&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="342" y="76" w="45" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="170" y="75"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Clarinete&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>106</x><y>75</y></point><point><x>106</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>310</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>311</x><y>76</y></point><point><x>106</x><y>75</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Clarinete&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="166" y="76" w="72" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="29" y="75"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Fagot&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>75</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>99</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>101</x><y>76</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>75</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Fagot&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="25" y="76" w="47" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1b823724, 1B826E12, 073ff5d4, 1b8301e4</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D97B24</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de viento-madera&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="5" sequence="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Dentro de este grupo están la trompa, la trompeta, el trombón y la tuba. Son instrumentos que poseen un sonido muy potente, y en numerosas ocasiones también forman parte de algún tipo de banda en las que el sonido tiene que propagarse al aire libre. Están construidos con un tubo muy largo que debe doblarse varias veces para poder trasladar y tocar el instrumento con facilidad. De ahí las curiosas formas que tienen.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de viento-metal&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>image_horns.swf</image><imagerefid/></caption><image>5_de-viento-metal.jpg</image><audiofile>0017A52A.mp3</audiofile><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="41" y="175"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Trompa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>174</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>135</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>138</x><y>177</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>174</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Trompa&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="37" y="176" w="61" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="132" y="2"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Trombón&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>171</y></point><point><x>139</x><y>171</y></point><point><x>141</x><y>173</y></point><point><x>142</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>269</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>141</y></point><point><x>313</x><y>141</y></point><point><x>315</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Trombón&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="128" y="3" w="70" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="348" y="2"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tuba&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>319</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>317</x><y>135</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>139</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>319</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tuba&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="344" y="3" w="43" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="7" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="237" y="275"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Trompeta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>142</x><y>275</y></point><point><x>142</x><y>373</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>275</y></point><point><x>142</x><y>275</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Trompeta&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="233" y="276" w="75" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1b826e1b, 1b8238c3, 1b823727, 1b823726</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D97B25</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de viento-metal&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="6" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Son muchos y muy variados los instrumentos de percusión que se pueden encontrar en una orquesta, desde los timbales y el triángulo hasta la marimba, el xilófono o la celesta, entre muchos otros. En ocasiones, también puede haber un piano como integrante de este grupo orquestal (como instrumento de cuerda percutida que es). Los timbales son los más llamativos, y se encargan de resaltar momentos de especial intensidad musical. Ya que los percusionistas pueden estar muchos compases sin tener que tocar, deben tener una concentración especial a la hora de seguir la partitura y no perderse.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de percusión&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>image_percussion.swf</image><imagerefid/></caption><image>6_de-percusion_new.jpg</image><audiofile>0017A52D.mp3</audiofile><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="8" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="174" y="192"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Timbal&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>211</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>212</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Timbal&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="170" y="193" w="56" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="8" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="334" y="347"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tambor&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>306</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>306</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>218</y></point><point><x>306</x><y>219</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tambor&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="330" y="348" w="61" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="8" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="34" y="347"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Bombo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>115</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>108</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>219</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Bombo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="30" y="348" w="55" h="17"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="8" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="137" y="347"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Platillos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>111</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>118</x><y>375</y></point><point><x>211</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>209</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>111</x><y>219</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Platillos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="133" y="348" w="63" h="17"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="8" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="231" y="347"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Triángulo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>212</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>215</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>303</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>303</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>212</x><y>220</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Triángulo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="227" y="348" w="73" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1b82b2ae, 1b826e31, 1B826E21, 42D97667, 42D97668</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D97B26</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Instrumentos de percusión&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="6"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La labor más importante de un director se desarrolla durante los ensayos. Es el encargado de interpretar la partitura y transmitir a los músicos de la orquesta su punto de vista sobre lo que el compositor quiere transmitir en cada momento. Esto quiere decir que cuando el director sale a dirigir la orquesta en los conciertos, ha realizado anteriormente un trabajo muy importante que el público no ve. Grandes directores han sido Karajan, Fürtwangler, Celebidache, Muti, Solti o Marriner, entre otros.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;El director de orquesta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image>image_conductor.swf</image><imagerefid/></caption><image>2_El-director.jpg</image><audiofile>00170830.mp3</audiofile><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid>1b822D36</imagerefid><audiorefid>42D96EDC</audiorefid><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;El director de orquesta&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="3" textdividerbarcolorid="3" creditsbuttonstyleid="9" resetbuttonstyleid="10" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="1" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="4" progresscolorid="3" guttercolorid="4" graphiccolorid="2" outlinecolorid="5" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="3" displaytextstyleid="3" selectedlisttextstyleid="3" rolllisttextstyleid="3" downlisttextstyleid="3" rolloutlinecolorid="6" displaybgcolorid="2" listbgcolorid="2" listoutlinecolorid="6" displayoutlinecolorid="6" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="6" thumbbasecolorid="7" thumbrollcolorid="8" thumbdowncolorid="8" buttonstyleid="1"/></popmenustyle><captionscrollbarstyle guttercolorid="6" thumbbasecolorid="7" thumbrollcolorid="8" thumbdowncolori